      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "SceneRef - RefMod Maker (MiniMax H3)\n\nMakes a DaSiWa RefMod in models/refmods: the pictures already encoded as MiniMax H3 latents, for the Studio's Cast list and DaSiWa's H3 Director.\n\n1. Name the character; add pictures with + picture, or start from a .char / RefMod as the source.\n2. description: name first, then what the pictures don't show ('Emma, a woman of about 40, wavy brown hair').\n3. Optional voice (Load Audio): 5 to 15 s of clear speech, stored as an audio member. Delete the Load Audio node for no voice.\n4. Run. Pictures are checked and picked like the Studio does (best first, face : body : outfit 2 : 1 : 1, small faces cropped) and stored at H3's full reference size (short edge up to 2048, never enlarged).\n\nNeeds minimax_h3_video_vae and minimax_h3_audio_vae in models/vae."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "SceneRef - RefMod Maker (MiniMax H3)\n\nMakes a DaSiWa RefMod in models/refmods: the pictures already encoded as MiniMax H3 latents, for the Studio's Cast list and DaSiWa's H3 Director.\n\n1. Name the character; add pictures with + picture, or start from a .char / RefMod as the source.\n2. description: name first, then what the pictures don't show ('Emma, a woman of about 40, wavy brown hair').\n3. Optional voice (Load Audio): 5 to 15 s of clear speech, stored as an audio member. Delete the Load Audio node for no voice.\n4. Run. Pictures are checked and picked like the Studio does (best first, face : body : outfit 2 : 1 : 1, small faces cropped) and stored at H3's full reference size (short edge up to 2048, never enlarged).\n\nNeeds minimax_h3_video_vae and minimax_h3_audio_vae in models/vae."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
